---
title: Pisco Sour
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, pisco]
source: Classic cocktail, number 21 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{} without ice, pour @pisco{2%fl_oz}, @lime juice{1%fl_oz}, @simple syrup{0.75%fl_oz} and @egg white{1}. Shake hard for ~{10%seconds}, add ice, and shake again for ~{10%seconds}. Strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled), and drop @Angostura bitters{3%drops} onto the foam.
